# Dataset

This project uses the **University Student Stress Dataset**.

- **Source**: [Mendeley Data](https://data.mendeley.com/datasets/rc5htd5dfr/1)
- **DOI**: [10.17632/rc5htd5dfr.1](https://doi.org/10.17632/rc5htd5dfr.1)
- **License**: CC BY 4.0
- **Size**: 3,000 student responses

## How to get the data

1. Go to the link above and click **Download All**.
2. Extract the zip.
3. Place the CSV you want to use in this folder.  
   Recommended files:
   - From `Raw_Responses/` → the original Google Form export
   - From `Cleaned_Data/` → the cleaned version (if available)

4. Rename it to one of these (or update the path in the notebook):
   - `raw_google_form_export.csv`
   - `student_stress.csv`

